   "html": "Data Viz",
   "text": "Data Viz"
  },
  {
   "html": "For us that means making digital experiences which create <i>emotional</i> connections between brands and people.",
   "text": "For us that means making digital experiences which create emotional connections between brands and people."
  },
  {
   "html": "Movement, surprise, wonder.",
   "text": "Movement, surprise, wonder."
  },
  {
   "html": "We bring brands to life through striking creativity and craft, taking people out of their everyday and into something more special.",
   "text": "We bring brands to life through striking creativity and craft, taking people out of their everyday and into something more special."
  },
  {
   "html": "For creative digital to be truly effective we must understand <i>who</i> your brand is. And who your audience are, what they want, and what you want them to know, feel and do.",
   "text": "For creative digital to be truly effective we must understand who your brand is. And who your audience are, what they want, and what you want them to know, feel and do."
  },
  {
   "html": "So our projects always begin with discovery and strategy, we call it our Think phase.",
   "text": "So our projects always begin with discovery and strategy, we call it our Think phase."
  },
  {
   "html": "We immerse ourselves in your world, understanding your most valuable and exciting points of difference<span style=\"color:rgb(32, 33, 36)\">—</span>then we amplify them in <a href=\"/work/\" target=\"_self\">incredible ways</a>.",
   "text": "We immerse ourselves in your world, understanding your most valuable and exciting points of difference—then we amplify them in incredible ways."
  },
  {
   "html": "Tell us what you want your brand to achieve in the world, say <a href=\"mailto:hello@gladeye.com\">hello@gladeye.com</a>.",
   "text": "Tell us what you want your brand to achieve in the world, say hello@gladeye.com."
  },
